00:26:30.181 --> 00:26:32.100
and then the people,
the nurses and doctors

00:26:32.100 --> 00:26:34.290
through the emergency
department through the night.

00:26:34.290 --> 00:26:37.800
I mean it is always worth just remembering

00:26:37.800 --> 00:26:41.400
that passion at the front line
and how whatever pressure,

00:26:41.400 --> 00:26:43.470
what a great job they do actually.

00:26:43.470 --> 00:26:46.050
- So David.

00:26:46.050 --> 00:26:47.806
- [David] Thank you.

00:26:47.806 --> 00:26:49.118
