00:36:14.730 --> 00:36:17.490
whether we've got any intelligence

00:36:17.490 --> 00:36:19.560
on the levels of dependency

00:36:19.560 --> 00:36:23.433
and comorbidity of those
people waiting for discharge.

00:36:24.510 --> 00:36:26.310
I think that'd be very helpful

00:36:26.310 --> 00:36:28.493
in terms of what is it
that we're going to do.

00:36:28.493 --> 00:36:32.070
I strongly suspect the
person admitted to hospital

00:36:32.070 --> 00:36:35.040
for fractured neck of femur
who is fit for discharge,

00:36:35.040 --> 00:36:36.806
but has advanced dementia

00:36:36.806 --> 00:36:39.450
is the person that's stuck in hospital.

00:36:39.450 --> 00:36:41.359
- I'm sure you're right.

00:36:41.359 --> 00:36:42.900
- And so this is as much
a story about complexity

00:36:42.900 --> 00:36:45.480
as it is about capacity and Richard,

00:36:45.480 --> 00:36:47.040
I'm not looking for an answer

00:36:47.040 --> 00:36:49.020
and I don't know, I really
don't know the answer.

00:36:49.020 --> 00:36:50.610
So this is a genuine question,

00:36:50.610 --> 00:36:52.380
but I wonder whether
there might be some work

00:36:52.380 --> 00:36:54.815
that we could commission just
to get a richer understanding

00:36:54.815 --> 00:36:57.540
of that particular issue

00:36:57.540 --> 00:37:01.050
because I suspect given my experience,

00:37:01.050 --> 00:37:02.580
I think that might be
helpful to understand

00:37:02.580 --> 00:37:04.848
what the hell's going on here.

00:37:04.848 --> 00:37:09.690
And if I may, the second
question or comment

00:37:09.690 --> 00:37:12.480
was in the annex,

00:37:12.480 --> 00:37:13.861
and I think it's paragraph 42,

00:37:13.861 --> 00:37:18.861
the progress in GP health checks of people

00:37:19.491 --> 00:37:22.050
with learning disabilities is recorded

00:37:22.050 --> 00:37:25.500
and I just want to pay tribute to the work

00:37:25.500 --> 00:37:27.450
that has been done to get that through.

00:37:30.390 --> 00:37:34.322
And then this week the
BMJ published a report

00:37:34.322 --> 00:37:38.820
saying that people with
a learning disability

00:37:38.820 --> 00:37:43.426
