01:36:11.460 --> 01:36:13.740
because they're not necessarily new,

01:36:13.740 --> 01:36:15.180
they're just different ways of working

01:36:15.180 --> 01:36:17.790
that maybe people
haven't thought about it,

01:36:17.790 --> 01:36:20.190
but we can always do
more is what I would say

01:36:20.190 --> 01:36:24.210
in terms of spread, the
question about sustainability,

01:36:24.210 --> 01:36:28.200
