I think this demonstrates

01:36:28.200 --> 01:36:32.100
significant productivity because as a GP,

01:36:32.100 --> 01:36:34.110
if I was sitting at the surgery,

01:36:34.110 --> 01:36:36.000
I don't think I would've
been able to cover

01:36:36.000 --> 01:36:37.620
