01:36:37.620 --> 01:36:40.440
all of those interventions within an hour.

01:36:40.440 --> 01:36:43.080
So I think it's a self-sustaining model

01:36:43.080 --> 01:36:45.660
in many ways and actually
very low investment

01:36:45.660 --> 01:36:46.920
for high returns.

01:36:46.920 --> 01:36:49.350
They've just used their as Wol was saying,

01:36:49.350 --> 01:36:52.754
