01:38:40.110 --> 01:38:43.650
And there was a feeling that
we probably need to speak

01:38:43.650 --> 01:38:47.490
into that space directly
through Core20PLUS5

01:38:47.490 --> 01:38:50.610
and doing the work more broadly

01:38:50.610 --> 01:38:52.710
with our local authority
colleagues around,

01:38:52.710 --> 01:38:55.530
and I was saying this a few
days ago that it's not really

01:38:55.530 --> 01:39:00.045
about access to dentistry,
it's about oral health

01:39:00.045 --> 01:39:05.045
and how we can use our education framework

01:39:05.100 --> 01:39:07.350
to be able to support that.

01:39:08.674 --> 01:39:10.883
- And I'm just going to
get Habib to answer...

01:39:10.883 --> 01:39:12.316
- I was just going to add

01:39:12.316 --> 01:39:14.610
