01:40:37.412 --> 01:40:38.967
is a really good example of
where we've done it well.

01:40:38.967 --> 01:40:42.810
But we have got to work
out and in one sense

01:40:42.810 --> 01:40:45.720
we might say the challenge
to Bola is to say, right,

01:40:45.720 --> 01:40:48.660
how are we and how do we support her

01:40:48.660 --> 01:40:50.430
and the team going to get the engagement

01:40:50.430 --> 01:40:52.530
with some of our national programmes

01:40:52.530 --> 01:40:54.165
to really get the focus on this.

01:40:54.165 --> 01:40:55.440
We were talking about screening earlier

01:40:55.440 --> 01:40:58.253
where Steve is doing some
really great work on this front,

01:40:58.253 --> 01:41:02.190
the examples in Ruth's area and maternity

01:41:02.190 --> 01:41:04.410
where it really is a focus
of the national programme.

01:41:04.410 --> 01:41:07.050
And I think that's the approach.

01:41:07.050 --> 01:41:09.120
We have got to work out how we build in

01:41:09.120 --> 01:41:12.480
so we achieve the difference at scale.

01:41:12.480 --> 01:41:14.210
- Very good, Amanda,

01:41:14.210 --> 01:41:15.420
you want to pick up David's question

01:41:15.420 --> 01:41:17.187
