01:41:17.187 --> 01:41:19.440
- Yes, thank you, can I pick up,

01:41:19.440 --> 01:41:21.649
I want to pick up a
number of things if I may.

01:41:21.649 --> 01:41:23.521
The first thing I'd just like to say,

01:41:23.521 --> 01:41:27.480
Bola is a completely inspirational leader

01:41:27.480 --> 01:41:29.940
and actually a great
example of what you could do

01:41:29.940 --> 01:41:34.940
